1
00:00:00,627 --> 00:00:01,837
- Penny called us.
- Penny?

2
00:00:02,004 --> 00:00:05,844
(Mrs Koothrappali:)She told us you're spending all our money
on your new girIfriend.

3
00:00:06,383 --> 00:00:08,463
(Raj:)I just got her a couple of things.

4
00:00:08,635 --> 00:00:09,925
(Raj:)She gives me things too.

5
00:00:10,095 --> 00:00:14,395
Yeah, yeah. I'm a gynecologist.
l know exactly what she gives you.

6
00:00:15,767 --> 00:00:18,977
(Mrs Koothrappali:)You need to find a nice Indian girl
from a good family.

7
00:00:19,146 --> 00:00:21,316
(Mrs Koothrappali:)If you keep seeing this woman,
you're cut off.

8
00:00:21,481 --> 00:00:24,191
What? You're gonna make me choose
between the woman I love...

9
00:00:24,359 --> 00:00:28,069
(Raj:)...and the money
I have very strong feelings for?

10
00:00:29,031 --> 00:00:30,161
(Dr Koothrappali:)It's up to you.

11
00:00:32,826 --> 00:00:35,786
- Well, I choose love.
- Heh, you're an idiot.

12
00:00:38,290 --> 00:00:40,370
(Dr Koothrappali:)Love doesn't last.

13
00:00:46,381 --> 00:00:49,011
(Dr Koothrappali:)Well, he's going to find out eventually.

14
00:00:49,968 --> 00:00:56,018
(Dr Koothrappali:)Think about it.

